      "content": "The idea of quiet sounds like a profound relief right now, a deep yearning for stillness that the world refuses to give you. If the external noise is too much, perhaps you could focus on finding a very small, internal anchor—a single sensation you can control, like the feeling of your own breath. Even a tiny pocket of internal quiet can be a starting point when everything outside is screaming.",
